re always helpful.<br /> <br /> Anyhow, I'm so psyched for Secrets of the Covenants to finally be here. Two weeks from now will be a good time, and it will be fitting reward for having plowed through a major project at work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I liked Matt's inputs too. Secrets of the Covenants coming out soon really fits into this vampire game I'm in because the players are joining covenants soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-29T07:29:54-08:00","id":1009774,"title":"","content":"Delighted to see it's coming out. What a nice Xmas present to us all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}